              class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full text-[11px] font-bold border bg-amber-50 text-amber-800 border-amber-200/90 hover:bg-amber-100 hover:border-amber-300 transition-all cursor-pointer shadow-2xs group"
              title="El cliente no ha fijado GPS. Haz clic para pegar o asignar coordenadas"
